Add INTEL_SIP_SMC_ASYNC_MBOX_SEND (function ID 0xEE) to send a generic
mailbox command to the SDM via the async SMC interface. Handle the new
COMMAND_MBOX_SEND_CMD in stratix10_svc_async_send() by resolving input
and output payload virtual addresses to their physical counterparts and
populating SMC argument registers a2-a6. Also handle the response in
stratix10_svc_async_prepare_response() by forwarding the SDM return
code via kaddr1.

